2. UPSTREAM DISTRIBUTIONS CATALOGUED
================================================================

The download URLs indexed in latest.json point to official, unmodified
rootfs archives provided directly by the respective Linux distributions.
Each distribution is governed by its own upstream license agreements:

Arch Linux / Arch Linux ARM
    Distribution: GPLv2+ / Various open-source licenses
    Website: https://archlinux.org | https://archlinuxarm.org

Ubuntu (Canonical Ltd.)
    Distribution: Canonical intellectual property policy & open-source licenses
    Website: https://ubuntu.com | https://cdimage.ubuntu.com

Debian GNU/Linux
    Distribution: Debian Free Software Guidelines (DFSG) / Various open-source licenses
    Website: https://debian.org

Alpine Linux
    Distribution: Various open-source licenses (GPL, MIT, BSD)
    Website: https://alpinelinux.org
